This package incorporates components from the following third-party project:

Microsoft Comic Chat
Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
Licensed under the MIT License

Microsoft Comic Chat's avatar and backdrop art is redistributed in converted
form: the fifteen character sprite sheets under characters/ are decoded from
its .avb avatar files, and the three backdrops under backdrops/ (field,
pastoral, room8bs) are decoded from its original .bmp backdrop bitmaps. Both
are format conversions of Microsoft's MIT-licensed art, which the MIT License
permits, and both carry its copyright.

